[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11222.6, "timestamp": "03:07:02", "text": "現在住在印度。天哪，天哪，天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11224.91, "timestamp": "03:07:04", "text": "[音樂] [音樂] 等等，世界上有我認識的人嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11258.469, "timestamp": "03:07:38", "text": "呃，那部動畫叫什麼名字來著？我忘了。  呃，他告訴我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11267.67, "timestamp": "03:07:47", "text": "要注意"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11273.23, "timestamp": "03:07:53", "text": "滑冰的事"}]